Description: Provides reproducible workflows for fitting, validating, caching,
    and diagnosing ecological generalized linear mixed models, generalized
    additive models, and generalized linear latent variable models. Functions
    support fixed-effect design-matrix checks, sparse-response screening,
    convergence and uncertainty validation, simulation-based residual
    diagnostics, cache invalidation based on analysis fingerprints, and
    validated estimated marginal means. Residual diagnostics build on the
    simulation-based framework of Hartig (2022)
    <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12849>, while mixed-model fitting may use the
    framework described by Brooks et al. (2017)
    <doi:10.32614/RJ-2017-066>.
